# Enduring Tenacity's two abilities together. Bot2's Lightning Bolt kills the 4/3 on turn 2 (its toughness is 3) and it returns to the
# battlefield as an enchantment, no longer a creature. On turn 3 Bot1's Witherbloom Charm gains 5 and the returned Tenacity, which still
# has its first ability, makes Bot2 lose 5 (20 -> 15).

